# Cleanup of the epic "Pod 3: Foundational Environment Setup" (ENTPMTS-143221)

Goal: the epic holds only the groundwork that the Capability 2 and Capability 10 stories build on (repositories, pipelines, dev environment and secrets, test data, the FIS paperwork, team conventions), with nothing that duplicates those two epics and nothing from the retired SQS design.

## 1. Where the epic stands and what to tell Joe

The epic has 15 tickets. Four are closed: the repository story and two ADR-update stories are Accepted, one ADR-update story is Canceled. The other 11 are in Backlog, unassigned and unpointed, created on 30 September from the epic's recommended-story list before the design was settled. Seven of them are duplicates of Capability 2 or Capability 10 stories, or describe the SQS layer that the synchronous design removed. Four stay and are rewritten; one story is added. After the cleanup the epic has 5 open stories, 19 points, finishing in sprint 26.4.5 (by 10 December), except the FIS paperwork story, which depends on the SOW.

